          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Independent finite integral:</strong> with\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta(x)=ax+b(1-x)-sx(1-x)||)</marimo-tex>, the integrands are\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-x/\\Delta||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(-(1-x)/\\Delta||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x(1-x)/\\Delta^2||)</marimo-tex> for\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(I(2,1)||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(I(1,2)||)</marimo-tex> and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(I(2,2)||)</marimo-tex> respectively.\nThe integration range is <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(0\\leq x\\leq1||)</marimo-tex>; the scale is <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\mu^2=1||)</marimo-tex>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='Xref-0' random-id='a34bea80-4d55-a87a-3596-4f1eaa8d30ce'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;s&#92;&quot;:8.0,&#92;&quot;a&#92;&quot;:1.0,&#92;&quot;b&#92;&quot;:4.0,&#92;&quot;IBP + OneLOop&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;(1.0693507508198925-0j)&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Parameter integral&#92;&quot;:1.069350750819896,&#92;&quot;Absolute error&#92;&quot;:3.552713678800501e-15}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='6' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
