    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "17a2aa603d57e1274d01e5b1b10b9fce",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Reusable symbolic-index recurrence</strong></span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: space-between;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\longrightarrow||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>D\u00b7s\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-D\u00b7a\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+D\u00b7b\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-s\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-s\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    +s\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-s\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+a\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+a\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-a\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+a\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    +b\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-3\u00b7b\u00b7n1\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-b\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>n1,0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>+3\u00b7b\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1,1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>-2\u00b7b\u00b7I<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-2+n1,2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-1+n1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-2\u00b7s\u00b7a-2\u00b7s\u00b7b-2\u00b7a\u00b7b+s\u00b2+a\u00b2+b\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Each of these polynomials must remain nonzero:</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-1+n1<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-2\u00b7s\u00b7a-2\u00b7s\u00b7b-2\u00b7a\u00b7b+s\u00b2+a\u00b2+b\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-2\u00b7s\u00b7a<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>2\u00b7s\u00b7b<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>2\u00b7a\u00b7b<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>s\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>a\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>b\u00b2</div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-2</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><code>rule.apply([2, 1])</code> specializes the indices for one recurrence step.\n<code>solution.reduce(...)</code> from Laporta already includes back-substitution.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The generic formulas above require <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(a\\ne0||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(b\\ne0||)</marimo-tex> and\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\lambda(s,a,b)\\ne0||)</marimo-tex>. At a vanishing mass or K\u00e4ll\u00e9n polynomial,\nconstruct a family with those kinematics and solve that case separately.\nA symbolic rule's remaining kinematic conditions also apply when its\ncoefficients are evaluated numerically. The presets here avoid those loci.</span></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    }
  ]
